        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Representation Theory - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A **(linear) representation** of group G on vector space V (over field k) is a group homomorphism:\n```\nρ: G → GL(V)"
    },
    {
      "id": "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:mathematics:24-representation-theory, git-history:mathematics:24-representation-theory]",
        "canonical_path": "mathematics/24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md",
        "concepts": "[representation, theory]",
        "current_path": "mathematics/24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md",
        "id": "maxim:mathematics:representation-theory",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "mathematics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[representation, theory]",
        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Representation Theory - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "That is: ρ(gh) = ρ(g)ρ(h) and ρ(e) = I for all g,h ∈ G."
    },
    {
      "id": "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md#009",
      "path": [
        "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
