        "root_concepts": "[representation, theory]",
        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Representation Theory - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Sign representation of Sₙ: ρ(σ) = sgn(σ) = ±1. Degree 1.\nStandard representation of Sₙ: subrepresentation of ℂⁿ (sum-0 hyperplane). Degree n-1."
    },
    {
