        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Representation Theory - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Consequence**: Irreps are the \"atomic\" building blocks. Over ℂ, the only intertwiners between distinct irreps are 0; self-intertwiners of an irrep are scalars."
    },
