        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Representation Theory - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Multiplicity formula:\n  mᵢ = ⟨χ_V, χᵢ⟩ = (1/|G|) Σ_g χ_V(g) χᵢ(g)̄"
    },
    {
      "id": "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md#033",
