      },
      "text": "```\nRows: one per irreducible representation.\nColumns: one per conjugacy class.\nEntry: χᵢ(Cⱼ) = value of character of ρᵢ on class Cⱼ."
    },
    {
      "id": "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md#036",
      "path": [
        "24-REPRESENTATION-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:mathematics:24-representation-theory, git-history:mathematics:24-representation-theory]",
